     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-disability</b></p><a name=\"ahip-disability\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-disability\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include all codes defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-disability-codes.html\"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-disability-codes</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://loinc.org\"><code>http://loinc.org</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA137-2/\">LA137-2</a></td><td>None</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html#AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-CNTR\">CNTR</a></td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient has chosen not to respond to this question at this time</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
